WwW-SiteConf-Ninja

The `ninja' generator of siteconf: `siteconf -g -G ninja' writes
build.ninja instead of a Makefile.  See RdKw::WwW::SiteConf::Builder::Ninja.

It is released with WwW-SiteConf, at the same version, and needs
that version.

    perl Makefile.PL && make && make test && make install
